### Root
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Get all properties
GET http://localhost:3000/properties

### Get property by id
GET http://localhost:3000/properties/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Get property by invalid uuid
GET http://localhost:3000/properties/not-a-valid-uuid

### Create property
POST http://localhost:3000/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Small studio in Malmö",
  "description": "A compact studio close to cafés and the central station.",
  "city": "Malmö",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 990,
  "max_guests": 2,
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688"
}

### Create invalid property
POST http://localhost:3000/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Missing valid title and invalid price.",
  "city": "Malmö",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 0,
  "max_guests": 2
}

### Update property
PUT http://localhost:3000/properties/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated apartment in Stockholm",
  "description": "Updated description.",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 1390,
  "max_guests": 2,
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267"
}

### Delete property
DELETE http://localhost:3000/properties/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
